WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:07.557
The Swords court cards describe four ways of using the
mind, from the curious Page to the fair-minded King.

00:00:07.557 --> 00:00:10.349
They can be people, parts of you or
approaches.

00:00:11.649 --> 00:00:12.615
Page of Swords.

00:00:12.615 --> 00:00:14.740
Curiosity, new ideas, a keen eye.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:18.476
The Page stands alert, sword raised, in a
windy landscape.

00:00:19.776 --> 00:00:20.843
Knight of Swords.

00:00:20.843 --> 00:00:22.412
Drive, speed, directness.

00:00:22.412 --> 00:00:26.554
The Knight is usually shown charging
forward with sword held high.

00:00:26.554 --> 00:00:31.386
He stands for acting on an idea at once,
with determination and little pause.

00:00:32.786 --> 00:00:35.171
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:35.171 --> 00:00:40.007
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
